OL,3,GNEWSAX-rays and ultrasounds offered in
OL,4,Apatients' homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients are receiving diagnostic care
OL,7,F- such as X-rays and ultrasounds - in
OL,8,Ftheir homes, thanks to a pilot scheme.
OL,10,FIn its first eight weeks, a mobile
OL,11,Fdiagnostic service covering Wiltshire
OL,12,Fsaved the NHS more than #100,000,
OL,13,Freleased 121 hours of ambulance time
OL,14,Fand freed up 203 acute hospital bed
OL,15,Fdays, according to Great Western
OL,16,FHospitals NHS Foundation Trust.
OL,18,FAfter securing funding to continue the
OL,19,Fscheme until the end of November, the
OL,20,Ftrust hopes to roll it out further to
OL,21,FBath and North East Somerset.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
