OL,3,GNEWSAX-rays and ultrasounds offered in
OL,4,Apatients' homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts deputy chief operating officer, Rob
OL,7,FPresland, said: "For some of our more
OL,8,Fvulnerable or frail patients,
OL,9,Ftravelling to hospital can be
OL,10,Fincredibly challenging and disruptive."
